      "content": "it's not just about 'fear' though. i have nothing left to show for my adulthood. i've used up my time, my funding, my reputation... it's all gone. how am i supposed to just 'rewrite' something when the foundation is completely destroyed? it feels like the most honest thing would be to just admit that i'm finished. that there's no version of the future where i'm not just a walking embarrassment. everything feels so final.",
